      "text": "In 1996, an immigration judge denied a Chinese alien’s asylum claim and ordered him to leave the United States. \n\nHe remained in our country illegally, but @ICEgov will finally get to deport him after being arrested at our West Palm Beach office. \n\nApplying for U.S. citizenship cannot have a murky path. When you have been lawfully denied multiple times, you can’t keep filing new applications.",
